mapping "V5550.1" source="V5550" target="242090001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V5550 = Swedish 5th-character extension of V55.5 SNOMED CT 242090001, with activity context.
        Base V55.5 (Athena concept 45756632) has edge to SNOMED CT 4054296 (Motor vehicle on road in
        collision with vehicle running on rails). Target subsumes source: every such pick-up truck vs
        railway train traffic collision is a motor vehicle on road in collision with vehicle running on
        rails. Lost specificity: vehicle subtype (light truck/pick-up), occupant role (driver), and
        activity context (sport). Moderate tier: crosswalk-verified at parent level, granularity lost
        via Swedish extension.
